WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
Crouching light punch whiffs before Ryu rises.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.400
Jamie catches Ryu with the performed light Tenshin command throw.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.050
Crouching heavy punch starts the command-throw juggle.

4
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.700
Heavy Swagger Step hits Ryu.

5
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.900
The full-stock forward-punch follow-up extends the juggle.
